{
 "description": "What a relic costs on Layered Gear's Relics screens (core/equipment/layered/relic_prices.py). Each relic of the price table is in one of two maps, by kind (armor, weapons) and look key. counterparts, over every other rule: a numbered relic whose unnumbered look of the same name is a normal look (MH4U's, or MH XX's for Death Stench) costs exactly what the run asks for that look, materials and zenny; a counterpart the run lacks (MH XX's without MH XX) prices the relic as one of none. monsters: the relic's monster, a family (a list: the dearest look of any of them), or \"none\" for a relic of no monster or of one in neither MH4U nor MH XX, each name a monster some look of the price table has. A relic of a monster costs what the run asks for the dearest look of its kind (armor for armor, a weapon of any class for a weapon; MH4U's and XX's; the highest zenny, then the most material units) at the relic's listed rank; when the run has no look of its kind of theirs, the dearest look of the other kind (an armor relic a weapon, a weapon relic an armor). rank_gaps: when the run has looks of theirs of that kind but none at the relic's rank, the relic costs its entry here, an invented price of its own rank (materials: up to two [MH4U English name, quantity], items of that rank the run must have; zenny: the point of the rank's range of the relic's kind, 1 its top); a relic with no entry then costs as one of none. A relic of none, of monsters with no look in the run, or of a counterpart the run lacks, costs its rank's tier below with its zenny times no_monster_zenny_factor. ranks: per rank (low, high, G), tiers in rising rarity. A relic takes the last tier whose \"from\" its rarity reaches (an armor look: the highest rarity of the pieces naming its parts; a weapon look: its weapon's), else the first. materials: up to two [item id or MH4U English name, quantity], gathered items of the relic's own rank only (ore, crystals, bones: never a monster's part, gem or plate); zenny: the point of the rank's range of the relic's kind in layered_looks.json recipes.zenny (0 its minimum, 1 its maximum).",
